      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i got a small cut on my arm a couple days ago from some garden tools and i've been cleaning it, but now i noticed this thin red line running up my arm from the cut. i also feel kind of shivery and run down. do you think i can just take some heavy duty ibuprofen or maybe some leftover antibiotics i have at home to stop it? i really dont want to go to the doctor or the ER if i can avoid it, it's just gonna cost a fortune.",
